(7592741, 1224711, 87808, '<td valign="top">I get it, very good!</td>', 'I get it, very good!', '2018-08-17 01:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592744, 1224723, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very clever, This is extended editing, so I would have painted the blown out spots on the nail and got rid of the blue on the left hand side. You also have a fair few burnt out pixels or white spots that could have been taken out. But over all , fantastic shot! Vote later</td>', 'Very clever, This is extended editing, so I would have painted the blown out spots on the nail and got rid of the blue on the left hand side. You also have a fair few burnt out pixels or white spots that could have been taken out. But over all , fantastic shot! Vote later', '2018-08-17 01:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592747, 1224341, 87808, '<td valign="top">I am not 100% sure I am understanding the description of the challenge, but think, if,,<br/>She was further down that road you have her on, it would be more impact-full.  She has passed everything, this was in her past, the new beginning starts at the last sign. For me, there is no before or after, she is still middle of the road. Vote later</td>', 'I am not 100% sure I am understanding the description of the challenge, but think, if,,She was further down that road you have her on, it would be more impact-full.  She has passed everything, this was in her past, the new beginning starts at the last sign. For me, there is no before or after, she is still middle of the road. Vote later', '2018-08-17 01:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592755, 1224702, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful shot.  I know who it is shot by and I know the story behind it. So I am going to be critical as I do not think that molly coddling you is the right thing right now. You have sensor spots or spots on your len''s, you need to clean that up, a lot. The white out, is obvious, and I know the keys are meant to hide it, but they don''t.  The RIP is almost lost in that brown, so making that darker would be better, maybe brightening it a bit would help too with some contrast for the keys. <br/> <br/>But it is a very dramatic before and after.  It engulfs this challenges description perfectly. If I had no idea, who this was for.  <u><i><b>IT</b></i></u> still would have been perfect photo for this. In my opinion, this is actually the only shot in this whole challenge, that clearly shows before and after, perfection then disintegration, build and tear down. So a 9 for this. <br/> <br/>But what would be more interesting, further along in this challenge or something similar came along, is how that became disintegration to rebuild, tear down to perfection, run down to re-live. <br/> <br/>Your life, is more than this, more than this disease. Your life is starting a new chapter, an interesting phase.  And you are going to capture it in minute detail and we will look upon it.  <br/> <br/>I am so so proud that you picked up your camera and started this first step after this news.</td>', 'This is a powerful shot.  I know who it is shot by and I know the story behind it. So I am going to be critical as I do not think that molly coddling you is the right thing right now. You have sensor spots or spots on your len''s, you need to clean that up, a lot. The white out, is obvious, and I know the keys are meant to hide it, but they don''t.  The RIP is almost lost in that brown, so making that darker would be better, maybe brightening it a bit would help too with some contrast for the keys.  But it is a very dramatic before and after.  It engulfs this challenges description perfectly. If I had no idea, who this was for.  IT still would have been perfect photo for this. In my opinion, this is actually the only shot in this whole challenge, that clearly shows before and after, perfection then disintegration, build and tear down. So a 9 for this.  But what would be more interesting, further along in this challenge or something similar came along, is how that became disintegration to rebuild, tear down to perfection, run down to re-live.  Your life, is more than this, more than this disease. Your life is starting a new chapter, an interesting phase.  And you are going to capture it in minute detail and we will look upon it.   I am so so proud that you picked up your camera and started this first step after this news.', '2018-08-17 02:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592756, 1224732, 87808, '<td valign="top">IMO, this would have been so much more dramatic without the city behind it. <br/>~~<br/>    NOW  I am going to do some assuming and jumping to conclusions here,and I am probably going to offend, which, I promise you I am not, I am going to say what this shot individually say''s to me, and only me.  But this chap, (to me) has some facial structures that remind me very much of the proud Aboriginals and the skeleton, is clearly a male skeleton, by the brow, nasal and prominent jaw line and depth of chest. To me, this is the first things that I see when I look at this picture. (((((I could be completely wrong (bar the skeleton, that is is correct) please do not be offended) <br/> <br/>To me, these are such prominent features, that I would in this Expert editing have done the Uluru Rock on the left hand side and progressed to the cityscape where the skeleton is. <br/> <br/>If I have offended in any way, please just message me and I take this comment down.</td>', 'IMO, this would have been so much more dramatic without the city behind it. ~~    NOW  I am going to do some assuming and jumping to conclusions here,and I am probably going to offend, which, I promise you I am not, I am going to say what this shot individually say''s to me, and only me.  But this chap, (to me) has some facial structures that remind me very much of the proud Aboriginals and the skeleton, is clearly a male skeleton, by the brow, nasal and prominent jaw line and depth of chest. To me, this is the first things that I see when I look at this picture. (((((I could be completely wrong (bar the skeleton, that is is correct) please do not be offended)  To me, these are such prominent features, that I would in this Expert editing have done the Uluru Rock on the left hand side and progressed to the cityscape where the skeleton is.  If I have offended in any way, please just message me and I take this comment down.', '2018-08-17 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592758, 1224715, 87808, '<td valign="top">I like this, as it is very DPC Clique. Just that glass in extra tiny (like thimble size) against that dinosaur orange, it kinda looks like 4 different shots put together, proportions are not quite right. And the right hand side of the glass is showing, versus the left.  But it is a DPC flashback, so 7 from me.</td>', 'I like this, as it is very DPC Clique. Just that glass in extra tiny (like thimble size) against that dinosaur orange, it kinda looks like 4 different shots put together, proportions are not quite right. And the right hand side of the glass is showing, versus the left.  But it is a DPC flashback, so 7 from me.', '2018-08-17 02:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592856, 1224702, 97225, '<td valign="top">Not the prettiest picture in the challenge but the one that meets the challenge description best. Top pick for me . 10 <br/>Best of luck with your new reality. I hope it all falls into place.</td>', 'Not the prettiest picture in the challenge but the one that meets the challenge description best. Top pick for me . 10 Best of luck with your new reality. I hope it all falls into place.', '2018-08-18 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593232, 1224706, 118154, '<td valign="top">cute stuff, best in show</td>', 'cute stuff, best in show', '2018-08-21 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593233, 1224341, 118154, '<td valign="top">Oh dear</td>', 'Oh dear', '2018-08-21 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593471, 1224446, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image --  ethereal, poignant, immaculately put together.  The upper girl/woman, shimmering and less distinct, lovingly reaches out, her sleeves shortened the better to unite and transform.  The background colors and texture nicely complement the figures.  The mood is calm and moving.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image --  ethereal, poignant, immaculately put together.  The upper girl/woman, shimmering and less distinct, lovingly reaches out, her sleeves shortened the better to unite and transform.  The background colors and texture nicely complement the figures.  The mood is calm and moving.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-08-22 19:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593473, 1224718, 173844, '<td valign="top">A terrific image, busy yet spare, and I''m gathering that there''s deep sadness in this woman.  There''s sympathy and empathy in her portrayal.  Her placement at the edge of the photograph, bustling street life in the background, emphasizes her marginal situation.  Yet her jacket flashes in the light.  Black and white helps make this real.  I have a feeling that this is not so much a defining moment as a descent.</td>', 'A terrific image, busy yet spare, and I''m gathering that there''s deep sadness in this woman.  There''s sympathy and empathy in her portrayal.  Her placement at the edge of the photograph, bustling street life in the background, emphasizes her marginal situation.  Yet her jacket flashes in the light.  Black and white helps make this real.  I have a feeling that this is not so much a defining moment as a descent.', '2018-08-22 19:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593476, 1224719, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.', '2018-08-22 21:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593477, 1224341, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top 3.</td>', 'In my top 3.', '2018-08-22 21:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593478, 1224709, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top 3.</td>', 'In my top 3.', '2018-08-22 21:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593484, 1224722, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s a cliche to say it''s all about the light, but here it''s what immediately catches my attention.  The frolicking dogs, the minimal but handsome scenery and the looming sky are all enough to make this a fine image.  Then the light, soft and enchanting, imbues the scene with the intimacy of a stage set. The joy of the dogs, the splash, complete this idyllic moment.  Wonderful.  I''m only left wondering about that ring of water and pillar of droplets off to the side.</td>', 'It''s a cliche to say it''s all about the light, but here it''s what immediately catches my attention.  The frolicking dogs, the minimal but handsome scenery and the looming sky are all enough to make this a fine image.  Then the light, soft and enchanting, imbues the scene with the intimacy of a stage set. The joy of the dogs, the splash, complete this idyllic moment.  Wonderful.  I''m only left wondering about that ring of water and pillar of droplets off to the side.', '2018-08-22 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593485, 1224718, 124815, '<td valign="top">Searching for the moment it all started? Haunting. Interesting pp for this moment</td>', 'Searching for the moment it all started? Haunting. Interesting pp for this moment', '2018-08-22 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593486, 1224703, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s the thing that we all tried and waited for its climax!</td>', 'It''s the thing that we all tried and waited for its climax!', '2018-08-22 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593553, 1224706, 173844, '<td valign="top">A sweet moment winnowed out of the passing day.  Within this glimpse is her loving, protected world.  Blithely, adroitly achieved.  I like the graininess of the black and white presentation.  Fine image.</td>', 'A sweet moment winnowed out of the passing day.  Within this glimpse is her loving, protected world.  Blithely, adroitly achieved.  I like the graininess of the black and white presentation.  Fine image.', '2018-08-23 17:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593554, 1224723, 173844, '<td valign="top">The most precisely defined moment of the challenge, refreshingly direct.  The delicacy of it gives a shiver of expectation.  Well done.</td>', 'The most precisely defined moment of the challenge, refreshingly direct.  The delicacy of it gives a shiver of expectation.  Well done.', '2018-08-23 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593555, 1224341, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her moment, her character, her decision is beautifully set up in a strongly graphic manner.  Her way is hazy yet she moves forward. I admire this image on several levels.</td>', 'Her moment, her character, her decision is beautifully set up in a strongly graphic manner.  Her way is hazy yet she moves forward. I admire this image on several levels.', '2018-08-23 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593556, 1224732, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific overlay, setting up an inner conversation that delves momentous matters.  How the clouds streak his face is marvelous, not in the least that they echo the skeleton''s rib cage.  Strong image.</td>', 'Terrific overlay, setting up an inner conversation that delves momentous matters.  How the clouds streak his face is marvelous, not in the least that they echo the skeleton''s rib cage.  Strong image.', '2018-08-23 18:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593557, 1224547, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice meditation on before and after, day and night and other weighty seeming dichotomies. I like how direct and simple it is, no frills, no pretension.</td>', 'Nice meditation on before and after, day and night and other weighty seeming dichotomies. I like how direct and simple it is, no frills, no pretension.', '2018-08-23 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593558, 1224727, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-caught moment of an expression that''s so iconic that we can plug right into her emotion.  The person next to her with her frilly hair ornament and the unassuming black and white presentation round the image out in a thoroughly satisfying way.  Great stuff.</td>', 'Well-caught moment of an expression that''s so iconic that we can plug right into her emotion.  The person next to her with her frilly hair ornament and the unassuming black and white presentation round the image out in a thoroughly satisfying way.  Great stuff.', '2018-08-23 18:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593559, 1224717, 173844, '<td valign="top">A winning portrayal of children at play.  I''d gamble that he''ll run right through.</td>', 'A winning portrayal of children at play.  I''d gamble that he''ll run right through.', '2018-08-23 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593560, 1224575, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, delicate image, like a mobile on the water.  I find it balanced even though there''s only the one boat on the left to all those trailing.  I also like the fleeting colors, patterns and textures.</td>', 'Lovely, delicate image, like a mobile on the water.  I find it balanced even though there''s only the one boat on the left to all those trailing.  I also like the fleeting colors, patterns and textures.', '2018-08-23 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593561, 1224737, 173844, '<td valign="top">An uncanny perspective that draws the viewer right in, challenging him or her to reestablish visual balance.  It''s almost an abstract, and quite becoming at that.  Vibrant in its own idiosyncratic way.</td>', 'An uncanny perspective that draws the viewer right in, challenging him or her to reestablish visual balance.  It''s almost an abstract, and quite becoming at that.  Vibrant in its own idiosyncratic way.', '2018-08-23 18:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593562, 1224703, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice cameo of a moment, brief and complete unto itself.  Enchanting even.  While not a fan of the peripheral blurring, perhaps you felt it artistically or practically compelling.  In any case, a charming image.</td>', 'Nice cameo of a moment, brief and complete unto itself.  Enchanting even.  While not a fan of the peripheral blurring, perhaps you felt it artistically or practically compelling.  In any case, a charming image.', '2018-08-23 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593564, 1224361, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a buoyant image!  It''s great how she shows such joy in a moment that many of us would find to be a drag.  I like how the background shouts "Big City!"  (There goes my allotment of exclamation points.)  Mary Tyler Moore redux.</td>', 'What a buoyant image!  It''s great how she shows such joy in a moment that many of us would find to be a drag.  I like how the background shouts "Big City!"  (There goes my allotment of exclamation points.)  Mary Tyler Moore redux.', '2018-08-23 18:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593565, 1224719, 173844, '<td valign="top">I hope he go it too.  Nice colors --  water is so generous with its beauty.</td>', 'I hope he go it too.  Nice colors --  water is so generous with its beauty.', '2018-08-23 19:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593566, 1224715, 173844, '<td valign="top">A splendid reinterpretation of sunrise.</td>', 'A splendid reinterpretation of sunrise.', '2018-08-23 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593567, 1224709, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine example of how the background can do so much for the foreground.  Here, it amplifies the saturation of the colors.</td>', 'A fine example of how the background can do so much for the foreground.  Here, it amplifies the saturation of the colors.', '2018-08-23 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593571, 1224510, 173844, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective that invites the viewer to jump in and imagine the picture being taken of the woman --  her leaning on the wall, looking into the camera, backed by the trailing colorful mural.</td>', 'An interesting perspective that invites the viewer to jump in and imagine the picture being taken of the woman --  her leaning on the wall, looking into the camera, backed by the trailing colorful mural.', '2018-08-23 19:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593574, 1224702, 114285, '<td valign="top">Must be a sad time for you, hang in there...and glad you have a sense of humour still.</td>', 'Must be a sad time for you, hang in there...and glad you have a sense of humour still.', '2018-08-23 20:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593575, 1224341, 114285, '<td valign="top">Some cloning issues near the sign posts, but  you need some recognition for all the hard work put into this.</td>', 'Some cloning issues near the sign posts, but  you need some recognition for all the hard work put into this.', '2018-08-23 20:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593576, 1224718, 114285, '<td valign="top">Spider-Man bag ha!</td>', 'Spider-Man bag ha!', '2018-08-23 20:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593577, 1224361, 114285, '<td valign="top">Look of joy in the rain, nice one.</td>', 'Look of joy in the rain, nice one.', '2018-08-23 20:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593579, 1224702, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ll make it through and, who knows, not to minimize your loss, someday find it to be a blessing.<br/>Thanks for introducing a new expression to me.</td>', 'You''ll make it through and, who knows, not to minimize your loss, someday find it to be a blessing.Thanks for introducing a new expression to me.', '2018-08-23 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593581, 1224711, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this image in light of the challenge.  What is amusing is that the crowns of trees are wearing a crown of concrete.  Maybe this is about the moment of usurpation of nature by the forces of "progress".</td>', 'I don''t understand this image in light of the challenge.  What is amusing is that the crowns of trees are wearing a crown of concrete.  Maybe this is about the moment of usurpation of nature by the forces of "progress".', '2018-08-23 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593583, 1223818, 173844, '<td valign="top">She looks happy in what I hope is more than a moment of relaxation.  Nicely symmetrical.</td>', 'She looks happy in what I hope is more than a moment of relaxation.  Nicely symmetrical.', '2018-08-23 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593605, 1224361, 68504, '<td valign="top">lovely colours/elements, lovely to behold.</td>', 'lovely colours/elements, lovely to behold.', '2018-08-24 01:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
