(7593609, 1224732, 68504, '<td valign="top">but the city is the background, i.e. so called civilization, which expresses the conundrum: is the civilization/the city the final achievement of man/did the city spell the death of man? is the city, finally, the thing that will kill us all?</td>', 'but the city is the background, i.e. so called civilization, which expresses the conundrum: is the civilization/the city the final achievement of man/did the city spell the death of man? is the city, finally, the thing that will kill us all?', '2018-08-24 01:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7593610, 1224732, 87808, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO, I just noticed the eye ball of the skeleton has a written paper behind it!!!!!!!!!!  and some more !!!!!!!!!!!!!! as I didn''t see it the first time. OOOOOOOOOOOO naughty miss!!!!</td>', 'OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO, I just noticed the eye ball of the skeleton has a written paper behind it!!!!!!!!!!  and some more !!!!!!!!!!!!!! as I didn''t see it the first time. OOOOOOOOOOOO naughty miss!!!!', '2018-08-24 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
