(7593615, 1224709, 87808, '<td valign="top">I will be honest with you, I gave you a 4. the thought is there, teh shot is there, it is just not a before and after.  personally, I felt , if you stomped on the leaf a bit, scruffed it up, made it more brown/moldy/decayed, maybe, used selective colours and brightness/contrast on only that decayed leaf, then this would have been a 6-8 from me. There is just so little comparison at the moment. I do like it though, as it has so much more potential.</td>', 'I will be honest with you, I gave you a 4. the thought is there, teh shot is there, it is just not a before and after.  personally, I felt , if you stomped on the leaf a bit, scruffed it up, made it more brown/moldy/decayed, maybe, used selective colours and brightness/contrast on only that decayed leaf, then this would have been a 6-8 from me. There is just so little comparison at the moment. I do like it though, as it has so much more potential.', '2018-08-24 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7593616, 1224727, 87808, '<td valign="top">Yeaaah, I did not get this at all for the challenge and I looked at it for ages. Just sort of looked liked you shot a candid then added grain and hoped for the best. Maybe if you added a description to your comments afterwards I would slap myself on the head and say "yep'' I get it now" I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=173844" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">streetpigeon</a> on his 1st sentence, but then I have no idea what he is talking about. I don''t think I am artsy enough to understand this photo or his comments  Sorry =(</td>', 'Yeaaah, I did not get this at all for the challenge and I looked at it for ages. Just sort of looked liked you shot a candid then added grain and hoped for the best. Maybe if you added a description to your comments afterwards I would slap myself on the head and say "yep'' I get it now" I agree with  streetpigeon on his 1st sentence, but then I have no idea what he is talking about. I don''t think I am artsy enough to understand this photo or his comments  Sorry =(', '2018-08-24 01:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
