(7593618, 1224711, 87808, '<td valign="top">Urrrgg, I am starting to think that <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=173844" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">streetpigeon</a> are on totally different side of the spectrum. I see the before, the nature, the undisturbed value of it, and it has invaded by man made structures. What was once, a peaceful time, place, nature, everything, is being overtaken by a concrete jungle as man takes over and takes away nature. I was one of your 7''s.  I got it.</td>', 'Urrrgg, I am starting to think that  streetpigeon are on totally different side of the spectrum. I see the before, the nature, the undisturbed value of it, and it has invaded by man made structures. What was once, a peaceful time, place, nature, everything, is being overtaken by a concrete jungle as man takes over and takes away nature. I was one of your 7''s.  I got it.', '2018-08-24 01:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
